## 3. Azure: ARM Templates

### What are ARM Templates?

**ARM (Azure Resource Manager) Templates** are JSON files that define Azure infrastructure declaratively.

**Key Features**:
- JSON-based syntax
- Parameterization
- Template linking
- Resource dependencies
- Idempotent operations

### ARM Template Structure

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "parameters": {
    "appName": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "maritime-platform",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Name of the application"
      }
    },
    "sqlAdminPassword": {
      "type": "securestring",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "SQL Server admin password"
      }
    }
  },
  "variables": {
    "sqlName": "[concat('sql-', parameters('appName'))]",
    "sqlDb": "[concat(parameters('appName'), '-db')]"
  },
  "resources": [
    {
      "type": "Microsoft.Sql/servers",
      "apiVersion": "2021-11-01",
      "name": "[variables('sqlName')]",
      "location": "[resourceGroup().location]",
      "properties": {
        "administratorLogin": "maritime-admin",
        "administratorLoginPassword": "[parameters('sqlAdminPassword')]"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Microsoft.Sql/servers/databases",
      "apiVersion": "2021-11-01",
      "name": "[concat(variables('sqlName'), '/', variables('sqlDb'))]",
      "dependsOn": [
        "[resourceId('Microsoft.Sql/servers', variables('sqlName'))]"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "collation": "SQL_Latin1_General_CP1_CI_AS"
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputs": {
    "sqlServerName": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "[variables('sqlName')]"
    }
  }
}
```

### ARM Template Components

**Parameters**: Input values for customization
**Variables**: Reusable values
**Resources**: Infrastructure to create
**Outputs**: Values returned after deployment

### Deploying ARM Templates

```bash
# Deploy template
az deployment group create \
  --resource-group maritime-rg \
  --template-file azure-infrastructure.json \
  --parameters appName=maritime-platform sqlAdminPassword=SecurePassword123!

# Validate template
az deployment group validate \
  --resource-group maritime-rg \
  --template-file azure-infrastructure.json
```

