## 8. MaritimeIQ Examples

### Azure Deployment

```bash
# Deploy infrastructure
az deployment group create \
  --resource-group maritime-rg \
  --template-file deployment/azure/azure-infrastructure.json \
  --parameters \
    appName=maritime-platform \
    uniqueId=maritime-001 \
    sqlAdminPassword=SecurePassword123!

# Deploy application
az containerapp create \
  --name maritime-api \
  --resource-group maritime-rg \
  --image maritimecr.azurecr.io/maritime-api:latest \
  --environment maritime-env
```

### AWS Deployment

```bash
# Initialize Terraform
cd deployment/aws
terraform init

# Plan deployment
terraform plan -var="app_name=maritime-platform" -out=tfplan

# Apply deployment
terraform apply tfplan

# Deploy application
aws eks update-kubeconfig --name maritime-eks
kubectl apply -f k8s/maritime-api.yaml
```

